# Next.js Security

Audit:
- App Router
- Pages Router
- Route Handlers
- Server Actions
- Middleware
- Server Components
- Client Components
- SSR
- Authentication
- Authorization
- Cache isolation

Never expose server-only secrets to client code.

Validate authorization on the server,
not only in the frontend.
